{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は遠出をして撮影しました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも途中で雨が降ってしまったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もその続きを撮影してきました(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までやったことない経験をしたりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/1092771/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなことしたかは楽しみにしててください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/1092771/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期末テストも始まりましたよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと2日っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/1092771/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜の乃木どこは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クッキングでした(´-ω-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分ではけっこうイケてると思ってたんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送見たら・・・全然ダメでしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/1092771/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でもつぶやいてることとか大丈夫かな？って思いました(;￣ー￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあの後醤油かけて味付けしなおしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなおいしい♪ってちゃんと完食しましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/1092771/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"b